        "@value": "Industry Events at Prismatic 2019 Registered Arts Assembly Participants Registered Arts Assembly Participants Prismatic 2019 features a range... <a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2019-archive/\"><span>Continue Reading</span></a>"
