        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1><br>Industry Events</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Since its inception, the Prismatic Arts Festival has been a platform for Indigenous artists and artists of colour to freely express their identities and visions, without restriction and without expectation of who they should be and what their work should say.</p><p>This mission has led us to this year’s theme: <strong>Embodied Resonances</strong>. Throughout this industry series, Indigenous artists and artists of colour will reflect on how their own relationships to the bodies they live in informs the art they create and what they seek to put into the world. This series aims to shift the consumption and discourse surrounding the work of Indigenous artists and artists of colour, so that these artists can create and share work that is truly representative and exploratory of their identities and artistic visions.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.tickethalifax.com/events/140428700/prismatic-2023-industry-series\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tREGISTER HERE\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1-768x512.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=640%2