acentre.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-05.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.thecarleton.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-02.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.rogers.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-12-12.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://afhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-14.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://nscad.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NSCAD-logo-01-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NSCAD-logo-01-1.png?w=300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NSCAD-logo-01-1.png?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
