    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Dance Battle</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Wednesday, September 28th | 5PM Doors open, 5:45PM event start<br><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#breaking-circus\">Breaking Circus Studio</a><br>PWYC Admission</p><p>in partnership with <a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\">Live Art Dance</a> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"1187\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid-768x1187.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=768%2C1187&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=194%2C300&amp;ssl=1 194w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=662%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 662w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=994%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 994w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=1120%2C1731&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?resize=640%2C989&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/dance_battle_ebnfloh_2_web_tabloid.jpg?w=1242&amp;ssl=1 1242w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Tap into your competitive spirit and come out to the Prismatic 2022 Dance Battle! Whether you’re a full-fledged pro, a dabbler in dance, or just enjoy expressing yourself through motion, we want to see your moves. Show off your skills, win over the judges, and take home the top prize! All levels, styles, and ages are welcome at this public event.</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;In partnership with Live Art Dance and Ebnflōh Dance Company.</strong><br><strong>This Dance Battle is open to all — join us as a battler or an audience member!</strong></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/5-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-73.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?w=800&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?resize=768%2C513&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/2-Dance-Battle-Prismatic-Arts-Festival-©STOO.ca-122.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Photo Credit: Stoo Metz</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to Industry Events\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"250\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-07.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-09.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-10.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.td.com/about-tdbfg/our-business/index.jsp?mobile=No\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-01.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.neptunetheatre.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-15.png\" title=\"sponsor-logos-15\" alt=\"sponsor-logos-15\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://liveartdance.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-17-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.dal.ca/faculty/arts/school-of-performing-arts.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-06.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://downtownhalifax.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-11.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/yhzmc-halifax-marriott-harbourfront-hotel/overview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-04.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://atlanticpresenters.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-16.png\" title=\"sponsor-logos-16\" alt=\"sponsor-logos-16\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.artgalleryofnovascotia.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-08.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://developns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/