        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Dance Workshop</h1>\t\t\n\t\t<p>Tuesday, September 27th | 6:45PM – 8:15PM<br><a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#house-of-eights\">House of Eights Dance Studio</a><br>FREE</p>\n<p>in partnership with <a href=\"https://www.kineticstudio.ca/\">Kinetic Dance</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://houseofeights.com/\">House of Eights</a><br></p><p>Prismatic is proud to collaborate with Alexandra \"Spicey\" Landé from Ebnflōh Dance Company to bring a unique dance workshop to the dancers at Kinetic Studio and House of Eights. </p><p>With its innovative choreographic language, Ebnflōh aims to inspire and influence not only the Montreal urban dance scene, but dancers in other Canadian cities and beyond. Ebnflōh seeks to build an immersive framework that creates space for artists to grow and share in their exploration of the creative process.</p><p>Dancers at Kinetic Studio and House of Eights will have the opportunity to learn from Ebnflōh and to connect through the spirit and culture of hip-hop! </p><p><b>This workshop is open to youth (13+) and adults with all levels of experience!</b></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1024\" height=\"634\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510-1024x634.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510.jpeg?resize=1024%2C634&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510.jpeg?resize=300%2C186&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510.jpeg?resize=768%2C475&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510.jpeg?resize=1120%2C693&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510.jpeg?resize=640%2C396&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Copy-of-Ebnfloh-In-Ward__Melika-Dez-Photography-e1662572531510.jpeg?w=1152&amp;ssl=1 1152w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/industry-events-2022/\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to Industry Events\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/canadian-heritage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"250\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-03-e1662144841715.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://canadacouncil.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-07.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.halifax.ca/parks-recreation/events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-09.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://artsns.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/sponsor-logos-10.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.td.com/about-tdbfg/our-business/index.jsp?mobile=No\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https