ener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">October 16th - 20th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/#jiv-parasam\">A Fictional Self </a><a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> &#8211;</a><a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/#jiv-parasam\"> Demystified Creation Masterclass with Jiv Parasram</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studio 2, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a> | <em>(open to FSPA students only)</em></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Friday, October 20th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>1pm – 2:30pm | <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"ht