        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Industry Events 2023"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h1>Industry Events</h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1-768x512.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/General-Industry-Series-1.png?w=1800&amp;ssl=1 1800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Since its inception, the Prismatic Arts Festival has been a platform for Indigenous artists and artists of colour to freely express their identities and visions, without restriction and without expectation of who they should be and what their work should say.</p><p>This mission has led us to this year’s theme: <strong>Embodied Resonances</strong>. Throughout this industry series, Indigenous artists and artists of colour will reflect on how their own relationships to the bodies they live in informs the art they create and what they seek to put into the world. This series aims to shift the consumption and discourse surrounding the work of Indigenous artists and artists of colour, so that these artists can create and share work that is truly representative and exploratory of their identities and artistic visions.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismatic.tickethalifax.com/events/140428700/prismatic-2023-industry-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tRegister Here\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<h2>Events Schedule</h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Monday, October 2nd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>12pm &#8211; 1:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/#syreeta-hector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Welcome &amp; Land Based Movement Workshop with Syreeta Hector </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#africville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Africville Museum</a></p><p>1:45pm &#8211; 3:45pm |  <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/arrivals-legacy-project-2023/#alp-meet-and-greet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Living History at the Crossroads: Arrivals Legacy Project Meet &amp; Greet</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#africville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Africville Museum</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Tuesday, October 3rd</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>2pm &#8211; 3:30pm |<a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2023/#sharing-circle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> The TALK: Art as Healing </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#central-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Room 301, Halifax Central Library</a></p><p>2:35pm &#8211; 5:25pm |<a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Weaving New Ways of Knowing Masterclass &#8211; An Arrivals Taster </a>| <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Studio 2, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a> | <em>(open to FSPA 4th year students only)</em> </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Wednesday, October 4th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>10am &#8211; 11:30am | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/the-talk-2023/#at-the-threshold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The TALK: At the Threshold</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#central-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Room 301, Halifax Central Library</a></p><p>3:45pm &#8211; 4:45pm |  <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/#anyma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Singing Workshop with Anyma </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://theclubinclusion.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Club Inclusion</a> | <em>(open to Club Inclusion members only) </em></p><p>3pm &#8211; 5:30pm |  <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/arrivals-legacy-project-2023/#alp-showcase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Showcase: Diaspora Kidz + Arrivals Legacy Project SeedPool </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#bus-stop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Bus Stop Theatre</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Thursday, October 5th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>3pm – 4pm | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Griot In You: Poetry Writing Workshop with Guyleigh Johnson </a>| <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#eoed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Every One Every Day</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Friday, October 6th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>11am | <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mending Fibres and Stitching Stories: Workshop with Lux Gow-Habrich </a>| <a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#eoed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Every One Every Day </a></p><p>2:30pm – 4pm |<a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/#jeanette-kotowich\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Joy of Jigging Masterclass with Jeanette Kotowich | </a><a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 0.95em;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studio 2, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Saturday, October 7th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>7:30pm | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mi&#8217;kmaw Craft Market</a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Sunday, October 8th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>2pm | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff; color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/workshops-and-events-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mi&#8217;kmaw Craft Market</a> | <a style=\"font-size: 0.95em; background-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#neptune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neptune Theatre Scotiabank Stage</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">October 16th - 20th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/#jiv-parasam\">A Fictional Self </a><a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> &#8211;</a><a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/masterclasses-2023/#jiv-parasam\"> Demystified Creation Masterclass with Jiv Parasram</a> | <a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/our-venues/#dal-arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studio 2, Dalhousie Arts Centre</a> | <em>(open to FSPA students only)</em></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a tabindex=\"0\">Friday, October 20th</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>1pm – 2:30pm | <a style=\"color: darkorange;\" href=\"ht