        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?w=1600&amp;ssl=1 1600w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?resize=1024%2C682&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?resize=1536%2C1023&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?resize=1120%2C746&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Mohamad-Sahraei.jpg?resize=640%2C426&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Mohammad Sahraei</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Sunday, October 5th | 2:00 PM<br /><a style=\"color: #ded9e9;\" href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/accessibility/#central-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Paul O’Regan Hall – Halifax Central Library</a></p><p>In collaboration with</p><p><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Cecilia-Concerts-SAC-LOGO-FILE-ENGLISH-WHITE-300x66.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"233\" height=\"51\" /></p><p>In partnership with </p><p><img src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Halifax-Public-Library-Horizontal-300x147.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"78\" /></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.ceciliaconcerts.ca/concert/mohammad-sahraei/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRegistration\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/mohammad.sahraei.146\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 504 379.78 504 256z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sahraei_mohamad/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInstagram\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.1 141c-63.6 0-114.9 51.3-114.9 114.9s51.3 114.9 114.9 114.9S339 319.5 339 255.9 287.7 141 224.1 141zm0 189.6c-41.1 0-74.7-33.5-74.7-74.7s33.5-74.7 74.7-74.7 74.7 33.5 74.7 74.7-33.6 74.7-74.7 74.7zm146.4-194.3c0 14.9-12 26.8-26.8 26.8-14.9 0-26.8-12-26.8-26.8s12-26.8 26.8-26.8 26.8 12 26.8 26.8zm76.1 27.2c-1.7-35.9-9.9-67.7-36.2-93.9-26.2-26.2-58-34.4-93.9-36.2-37-2.1-147.9-2.1-184.9 0-35.8 1.7-67.6 9.9-93.9 36.1s-34.4 58-36.2 93.9c-2.1 37-2.1 147.9 0 184.9 1.7 35.9 9.9 67.7 36.2 93.9s58 34.4 93.9 36.2c37 2.1 147.9 2.1 184.9 0 35.9-1.7 67.7-9.9 93.9-36.2 26.2-26.2 34.4-58 36.2-93.9 2.1-37 2.1-147.8 0-184.8zM398.8 388c-7.8 19.6-22.9 34.7-42.6 42.6-29.5 11.7-99.5 9-132.1 9s-102.7 2.6-132.1-9c-19.6-7.8-34.7-22.9-42.6-42.6-11.7-29.5-9-99.5-9-132.1s-2.6-102.7 9-132.1c7.8-19.6 22.9-34.7 42.6-42.6 29.5-11.7 99.5-9 132.1-9s102.7-2.6 132.1 9c19.6 7.8 34.7 22.9 42.6 42.6 11.7 29.5 9 99.5 9 132.1s2.7 102.7-9 132.1z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Mohammad, who came to Halifax, Nova Scotia in 2017, is a musician and ethnomusicologist originally from Iran, where he graduated with a BA in Music and an MA in Ethnomusicology, as well as an accounting degree and an MBA. He is a multi-instrumentalist (tar, setar, dotar, daff, and robab) and his composition and performance are focused on the music of Middle East and Central Asia. Mohammad has traveled internationally, researching the music of each country he has visited and collecting more than 60 different and unusual musical instruments. </p><p>Within just a few months of his arrival in Canada, Mohammad and his friends had formed Open Borders, a group of 30 international musicians. He also founded a second group, Tillit. He and his bands have played in various venues including the Halifax Jazz Festival, Everyseeker, Upstream, Multicultural Festival, Feast Festival, and in the Iranian and Indian festivals. He has also performed with the Rumi ensemble throughout Nova Scotia. And he has resurrected the idea of live music during silent movies, collaborating with both Dalhousie University and the University of King’s College. In addition to performance, composition, and arranging, Mohammad also teaches and holds masterclasses and workshops about the music of various countries.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?w=1920&amp;ssl=1 1920w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=1120%2C747&amp;ssl=1 1120w, https://i0.wp.com/prismaticfestival.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/3-website-Pisuwin-346832991_942014243680661_4538303676708427131_n.jpg?resize=640%2C427&amp;ssl=1 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://prismaticfestival.com/index.php/prismatic-2025/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack to 2025\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>"
      }
